#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_facodi.s_facodi_principles_ledger
msgid "Keep community contribution separate from publication, and make the editorial boundary visible when something is still under review."
msgstr "Gardez la contribution communautaire séparée de la publication et rendez la frontière éditoriale visible pendant la révision."

#. module: theme_facodi
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_facodi.s_facodi_process_timeline
